# Stock Market Site – Environment Setup

This project contains the initial environment for a stock market website hosted on AWS.

Folders:
- frontend: static website files (S3)
- backend: API code (EC2)
- infrastructue: AWS architecture notes, CLI commands, IAM setup

AWS services used (free tier):
- IAM user for development
- S3 bucket for frontend hosting
- EC2 t2.micro instance for backend
